This project is an independent MLX implementation of MOSS-Image. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenMOSS.

It reproduces the inference behaviour of software and models released by others:
- MOSS-Image (model weights and pipeline_moss_image.py), Copyright OpenMOSS, Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image
- Qwen3.5-9B (the text encoder weights MOSS-Image ships), Copyright Alibaba Cloud (Qwen team), Apache License 2.0.
- FLUX.2 VAE with the FLUX.2 small decoder (the autoencoder MOSS-Image ships), Copyright Black Forest Labs,
  Apache License 2.0. https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-small-decoder
- mlx-lm (used as a dependency for the Qwen3.5 backbone), Copyright Apple Inc., MIT License.

torch_randn.py and the strip-decoding VAE are adapted from felix-ab/flux3-mlx (Apache License 2.0).
